  "title": "Only machines with the causal powers of brains can think",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "28ae7cc4-e729-4dbe-a897-046143be0f32",
      "text": "A machine can think, since people are such machines, and an artifact with a nervous system like ours could think too. What cannot think in virtue of its program alone is a computer: only brains and machines with the same causal powers as brains can think.",
